1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:05,933
4:44. One ring. Two. Three. Four. Rosa
lips the numbers. Her finger rests on
the hook.

2
00:00:06,433 --> 00:00:09,967
On the fifth ring she lifts the
receiver. Sam presses record.

3
00:00:10,467 --> 00:00:14,933
Rule five. Don't say hello. Not hello.
Not who's this. Not even mm-hm.

4
00:00:15,433 --> 00:00:20,467
Rule six. Hold it a hand away from
your ear. Let it listen to the room,
not to you.

5
00:00:20,967 --> 00:00:25,700
Same room. Same waiting. Then
something new. A tiny sound. Someone
swallowing.
